<title>USA: Saliva Diagnostics in work with U.S. Navy.</title>
<headline>Saliva Diagnostics in work with U.S. Navy.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER, Wash. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saliva Diagnostic Systems Inc said it signed an agreement with the U.S. Navy's medical research and development command to work together on developing rapid tests for dengue fever, scrup typhus and leptospirosis.</p>
<p>The diseases are all common in tropical areas of Asia, Latin America and Africa, with some cases recently reported in the U.S.</p>
</text>
